      "description": "Returns the Agentgates compute docs, read live (markdown written for an agent to follow in one pass): the plans with live prices, how to pay the 402 on each network, how to poll a machine until it runs, how to renew it (any wallet may pay a renewal), how to sign owner calls (X-Wallet-Auth: EIP-191 over METHOD\\npath\\nnonce\\ntimestamp, by the wallet that paid), the controls (stop, start, restart, resize, update), and what a lost answer or a refusal means.",
